{"metadata":{"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:7YubiKit8WebAuthnO","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"WebAuthn","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WebAuthn","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"WebAuthn","roleHeading":"Enumeration","symbolKind":"enum","modules":[{"name":"YubiKit"}]},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"WebAuthn (Web Authentication) namespace."}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/yubikit\/webauthn"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit"]]},"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"WebAuthn Client","generated":true,"anchor":"WebAuthn-Client","identifiers":["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Client"]}],"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WebAuthn","kind":"identifier"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Contains the high-level passkey ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Client","type":"reference"},{"text":" and the request, response, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"data-model types defined by the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/www.w3.org\/TR\/webauthn-3\/","type":"reference"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"specification.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A passkey client and the W3C Web Authentication data model, mediated by a YubiKey.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"code":"WebAuthn","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" namespace provides a high-level passkey client (","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Client","type":"reference"},{"text":") that runs","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"overridingTitleInlineContent":[{"text":"Web Authentication Level 3","type":"text"}],"isActive":true,"overridingTitle":"Web Authentication Level 3","identifier":"https:\/\/www.w3.org\/TR\/webauthn-3\/","type":"reference"},{"text":" ceremonies against a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"YubiKey, plus the request and response types defined by the WebAuthn specification.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A WebAuthn ceremony involves three parties: the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"authenticator","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" (a YubiKey), the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"client","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" (your app, via ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Client","type":"reference"},{"text":"), and the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"relying party","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" (your server, which","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"verifies what the authenticator returns). The client is the communication path between","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"authenticator and relying party — and it verifies the relying party’s identity against","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the origin it’s bound to, so it can refuse to sign for a fraudulent site.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"There are two ceremonies. ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Registration","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Client\/makeCredential(_:authorization:)","type":"reference"},{"text":") creates a new credential and supplies its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"public key to the relying party for account association. ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Authentication","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Client\/getAssertion(_:authorization:)","type":"reference"},{"text":") proves to the relying party that the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"YubiKey is the one registered for the user. Both ceremonies follow the same mechanical","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"shape: the relying party supplies a challenge, the authenticator signs it together","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with the relying-party identifier, and the signature goes back to the relying party","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"for verification.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The pieces fit together as: a connection carries CTAP2 traffic, a ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/CTAP2\/Session","type":"reference"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sits on top, and ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Client","type":"reference"},{"text":" runs ceremonies on that session. Connections come in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"three flavours that all work for WebAuthn: ","type":"text"},{"code":"YubiKit\/HIDFIDOConnection","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" on macOS,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/NFCSmartCardConnection","type":"reference"},{"text":" for tap-to-auth on iOS, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/USBSmartCardConnection","type":"reference"},{"text":" on either platform. Pick the one that matches","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"your platform and form factor.","type":"text"}]},{"code":["\/\/ macOS — USB HID FIDO","let connection = try await HIDFIDOConnection()","\/\/ iOS — tap-to-auth over NFC:","\/\/ let connection = try await NFCSmartCardConnection()","","let session = try await CTAP2.Session.makeSession(connection: connection)","let client = WebAuthn.Client(","    session: session,","    origin: try .init(\"https:\/\/example.com\"),","    isPublicSuffix: { publicSuffixList.contains($0) }",")","","\/\/ Register a new passkey","let registration = try await client.makeCredential(","    .init(","        challenge: challenge,","        rp: .init(id: \"example.com\", name: \"Example\"),","        user: .init(id: userId, name: \"alice@example.com\")","    ),","    authorization: .pin(\"1234\")",").value","","\/\/ Authenticate","let assertions = try await client.getAssertion(","    .init(challenge: challenge, rpId: \"example.com\"),","    authorization: .pin(\"1234\")",").value"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Most apps start with ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Client","type":"reference"},{"text":". For lower-level CTAP2 access — raw ","type":"text"},{"code":"makeCredential","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" \/","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"getAssertion","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", credential management, bio enrollment — use ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/CTAP2\/Session","type":"reference"},{"text":" directly.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Client","anchor":"Client","identifiers":["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Client","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Authorization","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Origin","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/ClientError","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/ClientData","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/PublicSuffixChecker"]},{"title":"Registration (makeCredential)","anchor":"Registration-makeCredential","identifiers":["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Registration","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/PublicKeyCredentialCreationOptions"]},{"title":"Authentication (getAssertion)","anchor":"Authentication-getAssertion","identifiers":["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Authentication","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/PublicKeyCredentialRequestOptions"]},{"title":"Status Reporting","anchor":"Status-Reporting","identifiers":["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/StatusStream","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Status"]},{"title":"Relying Party and User Entities","anchor":"Relying-Party-and-User-Entities","identifiers":["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/RelyingParty","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/User","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/CredentialDescriptor","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Transport"]},{"title":"Ceremony Preferences","anchor":"Ceremony-Preferences","identifiers":["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/ResidentKeyPref